            "start": 33,
            "end": 38
          }
        },
        {
          "exampleId": "w:power#e-215982fdcd085874",
          "text": "With help from Tesla, Westinghouse’s firm developed a system using alternating current, which soon became the major form of power delivery.",
          "source": {
            "paperId": "paper-gaokao-2022-zhejiang-jan",
            "paperTitle": "2022年1月浙江高考英语",
            "groupId": "group:paper-gaokao-2022-zhejiang-jan:reading-b",
            "locator": {
              "paragraph": 5,
              "paragraphId": "block:paper-gaokao-2022-zhejiang-jan:reading-b:5",
              "sentence": 2
            }
          },
          "tier": "gaokao",
          "target": {
            "start": 124,
            "end": 129
          }
        },
        {
          "exampleId": "w:power#e-9a606d80801a757e",
          "text": "Dozens of retired coal-fired power plants could find new life providing backup or emergency power for the electricity grid (电网) — except this time without the need for fossil fuels.",
          "source": {
            "paperId": "paper-mock-chongqing-nankai-2026-m2",
