          "exampleId": "w:power#e-415bc99d019a890c",
          "text": "The United States rose to global power on the strength of its technology, and the lifeblood of that technology has long been electricity.",
          "source": {
            "paperId": "paper-gaokao-2022-zhejiang-jan",
            "paperTitle": "2022年1月浙江高考英语",
