      "examples": [
        {
          "exampleId": "w:power#e-05a3d516947cfa51",
          "text": "Sixteen stations of Barcelona’s subway system are part of its new MetroCharge project, whereby the energy from the underground trains’ brakes (刹车) is used to power the trains and the stations themselves, while the remainder is sent snaking through cables (电缆) to the surface to power plug-in stations for privately owned vehicles.",
          "source": {
            "paperId": "paper-gaokao-2026-ii",
            "paperTitle": "2026年普通高等学校招生全国统一考试（全国II卷）英语学科试题卷",
            "groupId": "group:paper-gaokao-2026-ii:reading-d",
            "locator": {
              "paragraph": 3,
              "paragraphId": "block:paper-gaokao-2026-ii:reading-d:3",
              "sentence": 1
            }
          },
          "tier": "gaokao",
          "target": {
            "start": 158,
            "end": 163
          }
        },
        {
          "exampleId": "w:power#e-c9009268b6de3a4e",
          "text": "Alvaro Luna, a professor of electrical engineering, said that the system is innovative in so far as it allows for recycled energy to be redirected to specific local uses – in this case powering electric cars parked nearby.",
          "source": {
            "paperId": "paper-gaokao-2026-ii",
            "paperTitle": "2026年普通高等学校招生全国统一考试（全国II卷）英语学科试题卷",
            "groupId": "group:paper-gaokao-2026-ii:reading-d",
            "locator": {
