          },
          "tier": "gaokao",
          "target": {
            "start": 185,
            "end": 193
          }
        },
        {
          "exampleId": "w:power#e-ccb2633efc1af7a0",
          "text": "However, one cell only produces 1 or 2 Watts, which is only enough electricity for small uses, such as powering calculators or wristwatches.",
          "source": {
            "paperId": "paper-mock-cq-nankai-2026-05-ninth-quality-test",
            "paperTitle": "重庆市高2026届高三年级第九次质量检测 英语学科试题卷",
